 "remarks": "Tucked away on a private cul-de-sac, this distinctive contemporary home offers an exceptional combination of privacy, space, and indoor-outdoor living on 1.15 acres in Westport. Surrounded by mature trees and lush greenery, the property provides a peaceful, retreat-like setting just minutes from downtown, schools, beaches, and town amenities. Designed to embrace its natural surroundings, the home features soaring ceilings, expansive windows, skylights, and walls of glass that flood the interiors with natural light. The beautifully renovated kitchen flows seamlessly into spacious dining and gathering areas, including a cozy sitting area with fireplace and a screened porch overlooking the in-ground pool and private backyard. A dramatic great room with vaulted ceilings and skylights adds architectural character, while the expansive grounds offer endless possibilities for outdoor enjoyment and entertaining. Upstairs, the primary suite is a private retreat featuring a sitting area with fireplace, two closets, and a beautifully renovated bath with freestanding soaking tub and separate shower. Three additional bedrooms and a full bath complete the upper level. With a two-car garage, in-ground pool, and over an acre of private land, this home offers a rare opportunity to enjoy tranquility, space, and convenience in one of Westport's most desirable settings.",
